OverTheWire Bandit: Level 11 → 12

Objective
Obtain the password for Level 12.
The password is stored in data.txt, where letters have been rotated by 13 positions (ROT13).

Steps
Log in as bandit11:
ssh bandit11@bandit.labs.overthewire.org -p 2220
Decode the ROT13 text:
cat data.txt | tr 'A-Za-z' 'N-ZA-Mn-za-m'

Result
The decoded output reveals the password for Bandit Level 12.
